@startuml lld-us3-sequence
title LLD-US3 End the session after 5 idle minutes: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant SessionFilter
participant SessionStore
Browser -> SessionFilter : GET /accounts
SessionFilter -> SessionStore : lastActivity(token)
SessionFilter -> SessionFilter : idle 5 min 2 s
SessionFilter -> SessionStore : expire(token)
SessionFilter --> Browser : 401, login page
@enduml